<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from two leading exchange dealers:</p>
<p>			 Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l   Dubai Exchange Int'l</p>
<p> U.S. dollar	 41.92/41.97		 41.90/41.95</p>
<p> Pound sterling    70.35/70.45		 70.30/70.40</p>
<p> Deutsche mark     26.25/26.30		 26.30/26.40</p>
<p> Japanese yen	0.358/0.360		 0.355/0.360</p>
<p> Saudi riyal	 11.15/11.17		 11.15/11.20</p>
<p> UAE dirham	  11.40/11.42		 11.40/11.44</p>
<p> Indian rupee	 1.10/1.12		   1.10/1.15</p>
<p> F.E.B.C.	     4.70/4.90 pct	     4.70/4.90 pct</p>
